  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]\n[Em]\n[Am]\n[C]Whoops I O-\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]D'd,\nShortness of\n[Em]breath.\nCall ambu-\n[Am]lance,\n[C]Tell my wife\n[G]I.\nError in\n\n[Verse 2]\njudge-\nment cut my\n[Em]life,\nNo second\n[Am]chance,\n[C]no guiding\n[G]light.\nI never\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]meant to cau-\n[C]se you\n[G]pain,\n[Em]I never\n[Am]thought I'd be the one who took the fa-\n[C]ll.\n\n[Post-Chorus]\n[Em]I got lost [D#aug]in the moment,\n[G/D]Assholes like to [G(b5)/Db]test the limit.\n[Gmadd11/C]\nSix minutes\n\n[Verse 3]\ndown,\nBreathing ma-\n[Em]chine,\nBrain not feel\n[Am]right.\n[C]The look on\n[G]you\nis killing\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]me,\n[C]Drowning in\n[G]shame\n[Em]but don't feel\n[Am]bad. Cause I\n[C]\n\n[Post-Chorus]\n[Em]Never feared [D#aug]consequences.\n[G/D]Hate regrets more [G(b5)/Db]than apologie-\n[Gmadd11/C]s.\n\n[Bridge]\n[G]\n[Em]\n[Am]\n[C]A year has\n\n[Verse 4]\npassed,\nlike photo-\n[Em]graphs.\nMy life is\n[Am]just\n[C]a scrapbook,\n[G]Of\nold friends and\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am]faded memorie-\n[C]s. Looks\n\n[Post-Chorus]\n[Em]like I pulled the [D#aug]rug from under my-\n[G/D]self. The fall's too [G(b5)/Db]much for me to re-\n\n[Outro]\n[Gmadd11/C]cover from. It's been real\n[Am]fun but now I must\n[C]say goodbye. I'll\n[G]see you all at Oki Dogs,\n[G7]See you all at Oki Dogs.\n[C]\n[Cm]",
